      "value": "@{60c0e22718009c104862d5bc|full_name}: quick question is for those using ETC have they used crunch compression? In terms of space on memory the 6x6 format should take up less than ETC, and at 8x8 that would be half the amount of memory ETC takes up. There are other possible methods you can do to reduce the space the textures take up, but it's a bit advanced and not a lot of people would want to put in that work.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
